+### 0535 — Host VPN production start errors are normalized at both Apple seams (TASK-260715-1rsqrh)
+- FIX: Both iOS and macOS `VPNHostSession` adapters now catch synchronous `NETunnelProviderSession.startTunnel(options:)` errors and translate them through the existing `VPNPreferencePlatformError` model before crossing into `VPNSessionController`. Public `NEVPNError.configurationInvalid`, `.configurationDisabled`, and `.connectionFailed` retain their stable results; every other `NSError` retains its original domain and integer code.
